<title>UK: UK's OFT considers review of Pilkington buy.</title>
<headline>UK's OFT considers review of Pilkington buy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Office of Fair Trading said on Tuesday it was considering whether Pilkington Plc's acquisition of Plyglass Plc, a unit of Greenbrook Industries, qualified for a merger investigation.</p>
<p>The office said in a statement that it would consider referring the merger to the UK Monopolies and Mergers Commission if the acquisition was found to qualify for a merger investigation.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
